# BE monorepo (BE scope)

Full workspace layout: [../../shared/rules/turbo-workspace.mdc](../../shared/rules/turbo-workspace.mdc)

BE reminders:

- DB only in `packages/database`; wire via `@repo/database` in `apps/api`
- HTTP contract only in `packages/api` — map in services, not controllers
- Do not duplicate DTOs in `apps/api` when `@repo/api` already defines them

Detail: [../docs/09-monorepo-and-commands.md](../docs/09-monorepo-and-commands.md)
